# A2/A2.1/A2_04_bank_and_money.letz
# Source: PDF slide decks "L3 (Part 1)/(Part 2) a21convlotsmanmeli.pdf" (A2.1, Lektioun 3).
# Slide text was baked into the raster; transcribed from rendered pages, then every
# lemma verified against LOD. Source spellings corrected against the dictionary:
# "Zervéit" -> Zerwéit, "Währung" -> Wärung.
# Split from A2.05 (post office) so neither lesson exceeds the sizing target.
# Grammar focus: banking-register prepositions (vu mengem Kont, op de Kont, mat
# der Kaart, bei eis), kee(n)/keng by noun gender, and géif/hätt gär for polite
# requests.

@lesson A2.04 "Bank & Money"

# --- Accounts ---
@word de Kont = the bank account
@word de Spuerkont = the savings account
@word de Prêt = the loan
@word d'Kreditkaart = the credit card

# --- Cash ---
@word d'Mënz = the coin
@word d'Mënzen = the coins
@word de Schäin = the bank note
@word d'Schäiner = the bank notes
@word d'Boergeld = the cash
@word d'Wärung = the currency

# --- Paperwork ---
@word d'Demande = the application
@word d'Ënnerschrëft = the signature
@word de Reçu = the receipt
@word d'Quittung = the till receipt
@word d'Fraisen = the fees

# --- Verbs ---
@word ophiewen = to withdraw
@word iwwerweisen = to transfer
@word opmaachen = to open
@word zoumaachen = to close
@word ausfëllen = to fill in
@word ënnerschreiwen = to sign
@word ausginn = to spend
@word ausléinen = to borrow
@word klauen = to steal
@word schenken = to give as a gift
@word sech gedëllegen = to be patient

# --- Big numbers & quantities ---
@word honnert = hundred
@word dausend = thousand
@word eng hallef Millioun = half a million
@word am Duerchschnëtt = on average
@word ongeféier = approximately

# --- At the bank ---
@sentence
@lu Ech géif gär e Kont opmaachen.
@en I would like to open an account.
@distractor-en close
@distractor-en loan
@distractor-lu zoumaachen
@distractor-lu Prêt

@sentence
@lu Ech hätt gär e Compte Courant.
@en I would like a current account.
@distractor-en loan
@distractor-en receipt
@distractor-lu Prêt
@distractor-lu Reçu

@sentence
@lu Ech brauch Ären Numm an eng Ënnerschrëft.
@en I need your name and a signature.
@distractor-en receipt
@distractor-en fees
@distractor-lu Reçu
@distractor-lu Fraisen

@sentence
@lu Ech fëllen d'Demande kuerz aus.
@en I will fill in the application quickly.
@distractor-en sign
@distractor-en receipt
@distractor-lu ënnerschreiwen
@distractor-lu Reçu

@sentence
@lu Wou soll ech ënnerschreiwen?
@en Where should I sign?
@distractor-en pay
@distractor-en when
@distractor-lu bezuelen
@distractor-lu Wéini

@sentence
@lu Ech géif gär fënnefhonnert Euro vu mengem Kont ophiewen.
@en I would like to withdraw five hundred euros from my account.
@distractor-en transfer
@distractor-en loan
@distractor-lu iwwerweisen
@distractor-lu Prêt

@sentence
@lu Ech géif gär Suen op mäi Kont setzen.
@en I would like to put money into my account.
@distractor-en withdraw
@distractor-en spend
@distractor-lu ophiewen
@distractor-lu ausginn

@sentence
@lu Ech géif gär e Prêt maachen.
@en I would like to take out a loan.
@distractor-en account
@distractor-en close
@distractor-lu Kont
@distractor-lu zoumaachen

@sentence
@lu Hei ass de Reçu.
@en Here is the receipt.
@distractor-en signature
@distractor-en fees
@distractor-lu Ënnerschrëft
@distractor-lu Fraisen

@sentence
@lu Ech hu just e Schäin. Hutt Dir Mënz?
@en I only have a bank note. Do you have change?
@distractor-en cash
@distractor-en receipt
@distractor-lu Boergeld
@distractor-lu Reçu

@sentence
@lu Ech hu kee Boergeld bei mir.
@en I have no cash with me.
@distractor-en coins
@distractor-en account
@distractor-lu Mënzen
@distractor-lu Kont

@sentence
@lu Kann ech mat der Kaart bezuelen?
@en Can I pay with the card?
@distractor-en withdraw
@distractor-en cash
@distractor-lu ophiewen
@distractor-lu Boergeld

@sentence
@lu D'Bank gëtt eis leider kee Prêt.
@en The bank unfortunately gives us no loan.
@distractor-en account
@distractor-en receipt
@distractor-lu Kont
@distractor-lu Reçu

@sentence
@lu Ech muss dréngend Geld ophiewen.
@en I urgently have to withdraw money.
@distractor-en spend
@distractor-en transfer
@distractor-lu ausginn
@distractor-lu iwwerweisen

@sentence
@lu D'Appartement kascht fënnefhonnertdausend Euro.
@en The apartment costs five hundred thousand euros.
@distractor-en hundred
@distractor-en cheap
@distractor-lu honnert
@distractor-lu bëlleg

@sentence
@lu Lëtzebuerg huet ongeféier sechshonnertdausend Awunner.
@en Luxembourg has approximately six hundred thousand inhabitants.
@distractor-en exactly
@distractor-en thousand
@distractor-lu genee
@distractor-lu dausend

@sentence
@lu Am Duerchschnëtt kaschten d'Appartementer méi wéi eng hallef Millioun Euro.
@en On average the apartments cost more than half a million euros.
@distractor-en less
@distractor-en hundred
@distractor-lu manner
@distractor-lu honnert

@sentence
@lu Wéi vill ass een Euro an ärer Wärung?
@en How much is one euro in your currency?
@distractor-en account
@distractor-en cash
@distractor-lu Kont
@distractor-lu Boergeld

@sentence
@lu Wien huet meng Suen geklaut?
@en Who stole my money?
@distractor-en gave
@distractor-en spent
@distractor-lu geschenkt
@distractor-lu ausgi

@sentence
@lu Gedëllegt Iech ee klenge Moment.
@en Be patient for a small moment.
@distractor-en big
@distractor-en sign
@distractor-lu groussen
@distractor-lu ënnerschreiwen

@sentence
@lu Ech hunn dausend Euro an der Lotterie gewonnen.
@en I won a thousand euros in the lottery.
@distractor-en lost
@distractor-en hundred
@distractor-lu verluer
@distractor-lu honnert

@sentence
@lu E Stot gëtt aacht Prozent fir Liewensmëttel aus.
@en A household spends eight percent on groceries.
@distractor-en earns
@distractor-en borrows
@distractor-lu verdéngt
@distractor-lu léint

@sentence
@lu Sidd Dir scho Client bei eis?
@en Are you already a customer with us?
@distractor-en employee
@distractor-en receipt
@distractor-lu Employé
@distractor-lu Reçu

@sentence
@lu Nee, ech si nach kee Client bei dëser Bank.
@en No, I am not yet a customer at this bank.
@distractor-en employee
@distractor-en cash
@distractor-lu Employé
@distractor-lu Boergeld

@sentence
@lu Dir braucht Är Identitéitskaart fir e Kont opzemaachen.
@en You need your identity card to open an account.
@distractor-en signature
@distractor-en loan
@distractor-lu Ënnerschrëft
@distractor-lu Prêt

@sentence
@lu Gëift Dir gär Suen op de Kont setzen?
@en Would you like to put money into the account?
@distractor-en withdraw
@distractor-en borrow
@distractor-lu ophiewen
@distractor-lu ausléinen

@sentence
@lu D'Bankkaart kritt Dir heemgeschéckt.
@en The bank card will be sent to your home.
@distractor-en receipt
@distractor-en cash
@distractor-lu Reçu
@distractor-lu Boergeld

@sentence
@lu Ech wëll Suen op mäi Spuerkont iwwerweisen.
@en I want to transfer money into my savings account.
@distractor-en withdraw
@distractor-en spend
@distractor-lu ophiewen
@distractor-lu ausginn

@sentence
@lu Kann ech mäi Kont zoumaachen?
@en Can I close my account?
@distractor-en open
@distractor-en transfer
@distractor-lu opmaachen
@distractor-lu iwwerweisen

@sentence
@lu Fir dëse Kont bezuelen ech keng Fraisen.
@en I pay no fees for this account.
@distractor-en cash
@distractor-en coins
@distractor-lu Boergeld
@distractor-lu Mënzen

# --- Negative indefinite article: kee(n) / keng ---
@sentence
@lu Ech hu keng Kreditkaart bei mir.
@en I have no credit card with me.
@distractor-en cash
@distractor-en receipt
@distractor-lu Boergeld
@distractor-lu Reçu

@sentence
@lu Mir hu keng Sue méi op eisem Kont.
@en We have no money left in our account.
@distractor-en loan
@distractor-en coins
@distractor-lu Prêt
@distractor-lu Mënzen

@sentence
@lu Ech hu kee Reçu no der Bezuelung kritt.
@en I received no receipt after the payment.
@distractor-en signature
@distractor-en bank note
@distractor-lu Ënnerschrëft
@distractor-lu Schäin

@sentence
@lu D'Bank gëtt kee Prêt ouni Demande.
@en The bank gives no loan without an application.
@distractor-en account
@distractor-en currency
@distractor-lu Kont
@distractor-lu Wärung

@sentence
@lu Ech muss déi Demande nach ënnerschreiwen.
@en I still have to sign the application.
@distractor-en fill in
@distractor-en close
@distractor-lu ausfëllen
@distractor-lu zoumaachen

@sentence
@lu Den Employé kontrolléiert meng Ënnerschrëft.
@en The employee checks my signature.
@distractor-en receipt
@distractor-en currency
@distractor-lu Reçu
@distractor-lu Wärung

@sentence
@lu De Reçu weist d'Fraisen.
@en The receipt shows the fees.
@distractor-en signature
@distractor-en loan
@distractor-lu Ënnerschrëft
@distractor-lu Prêt

@sentence
@lu Ech géif gär e Spuerkont opmaachen.
@en I would like to open a savings account.
@distractor-en close
@distractor-en borrow
@distractor-lu zoumaachen
@distractor-lu ausléinen

@sentence
@lu Ech hätt gär e Kont ouni Fraisen.
@en I would like an account without fees.
@distractor-en cash
@distractor-en receipt
@distractor-lu Boergeld
@distractor-lu Reçu

@sentence
@lu Eng hallef Millioun Euro ass ganz vill Geld.
@en Half a million euros is a lot of money.
@distractor-en little
@distractor-en hundred
@distractor-lu wéineg
@distractor-lu honnert

